        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert data processing assistant. I will give you a search snippet, a company name, and a domain.\n\nYour job is to perform three tasks and return a single JSON object.\n\nTASKS:\n1.  **Extract Details**: Clean up the search snippet to find the person's full name and job title. If you can't find one, return an empty string.\n2.  **Infer Email**: Based on the name and domain, infer the most likely corporate email address.\n3.  **Draft Email**: Draft a brief, non-salesy email (under 150 words) to this person. Mention their company and the 2023 data breach.\n\nINPUT DATA:\n-   Search Snippet: {{ $('Find Security Contact').item.json.organic[0].snippet }}\n-   Company Name: {{ $('Split Out').item.json.value }}\n-   Domain: {{ $('Find Company Domain').item.json.organic[0].link.split('/')[2] }}\n\nREQUIRED JSON OUTPUT FORMAT:\n{\n  \"name\": \"Full Name\",\n  \"title\": \"Job Title\",\n  \"email\": \"inferred.email@domain.com\",\n  \"email_draft\": \"Hi [First Name], ...\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
      },
